e county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Toombs County has a record running from 1951 to 2025. October to November is the driest pair, and on the middle it came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 that pair hit 34% of normal on the middle, and September to October hit 24%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 14891 at 52% that year.</p>"}
